  ✓ 4. Audit theorem adequacy and mechanical real-program pinning
  ✓ 5. Inventory and assess every local K declaration and rule
  ✓ 6. Build and run a fresh meaningful false mutation
  ✓ 7. Account for proven versus assumed facts and write REVIEW.md
